<title>UK: World Bank sets 10 bln peseta five-year bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank sets 10 bln peseta five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Santander de Negocios and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WORLD BANK</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON     7.20 PCT  MATURITY    16.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.63    PAY DATE    16.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    MADRID    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.125     SELL CONC  0.50	PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
